  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "CreativePSD",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tDataset Card for CreativePSD\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tDataset Summary\n\t\n\nCreativePSD is the PSD-derived graphic design dataset released with PSDesigner. Each example is a poster archive containing PSD tree text, structured layer metadata, tool-call trajectories, source image resources, and stepwise rendered images.\nThis loader keeps the contents of each poster_*.zip archive: all metadata text/JSON files, all raw_resource images, all rendering_imgs images, and a manifest of every member in\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/creative-graphic-design/CreativePSD.",
  "alternateName": [
    "creative-graphic-design/CreativePSD",
    "CreativePSD"
  ],
  "creator": {
    "@type": "Organization",
    "name": "Creative Graphic Design Lab",
    "url": "https://huggingface.co/creative-graphic-design"
  },
